[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31900400_01_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31900400_01_0010","text":"哇……好舒服啊～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31900400_01_0020","text":"呼……\n长时间的拍摄，意外地也不赖嘛……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31900400_01_0030","text":"……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31900400_01_0040","text":"朝日～。这里的水很烫，\n要是潜下去的话容易泡晕的哦～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31900400_01_0050","text":"确实，感觉有点晕乎乎的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31900400_01_0060","text":"诶……！？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31900400_01_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31900400_01_0065","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31900400_01_0070","text":"来，朝日\n喝点水～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31900400_01_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31900400_01_0080","text":"……\n哈～……好好喝～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31900400_01_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31900400_01_0090","text":"……\n还好爱依发现得早"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31900400_01_0100","text":"以前给弟弟妹妹洗澡的时候嘛～\n也发生过这种事呢～"}]
